# ============================================================
# This repo publishes the BUILT SITE only.
#
# Everything jemdoc reads to produce the HTML -- the .jemdoc sources, MENU,
# the .conf files, the build scripts and jemdoc itself -- lives on the author's
# machine and is deliberately not tracked. Workflow: edit the .jemdoc, run
# docs/build.ps1, commit the regenerated .html.
#
# Kept on purpose even though they are not HTML or images, because the live
# pages load them: docs/blog/post.js, the three .css files, docs/CNAME,
# docs/.nojekyll, and docs/blog/icons/LICENSE-fluent-emoji.txt (the licence for
# the emoji artwork this site redistributes).
# ============================================================

# jemdoc sources and build tooling
*.jemdoc
docs/MENU
docs/*.conf
docs/build.ps1
docs/build.bat
/jemdoc
/latexmath2png.py

# working notes and agent config, not part of the site
.claude/
docs/AGENTS.md
docs/blog/README.md
docs/blog/icons/README.md
docs/blog/machine-unlearning/images/README.md
docs/blog/machine-unlearning/images/paper-figures.json

# the visitor-log tool is a separate program, not part of the site
visitor-log/

# upstream jemdoc leftovers, referenced by nothing on this site
/css/
/example/
/notes
/Makefile
